OL,3,GNEWSARoad blocked for seven miles after
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dual carriageway was blocked for
OL,7,Fseven miles (11.54 km) following a
OL,8,Ftwo-vehicle crash.
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,11,Fsent three crews to junction 47 of the
OL,12,FA14 westbound carriageway at Woolpit at
OL,13,Fabout 07:55 BST to help extricate a
OL,14,Fmale driver from one of the vehicles.
OL,16,FNational Highways said there were long
OL,17,Fdelays with congestion back to junction
OL,18,F50 for Stowmarket, while a police
OL,19,Fspokesperson added that no injuries had
OL,20,Fbeen reported.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
